            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>THE AIRMAP SYSTEM</strong><br/><br/>Airflow, mapped into every pair.</p><p>Most socks trap heat. Pearler socks have ventilation channels knitted in, so air keeps moving around your foot, even inside a leather shoe. Extra panels absorb sweat where your foot needs it most, so you stay dry from the first meeting to the last.</p><p><strong>AND TWO MORE THINGS YOU WON’T FIND IN ANOTHER SOCK</strong></p><p><strong>Exact sizing.</strong> Made in your size, not a size range. Your size is printed on the sole, under the P. No bunching, no slipping, no stretching out.</p><p><strong>Three thicknesses.</strong> Feather, Core and Cloud, so you choose the cushioning your day needs.</p>",
